<title>FRANCE: Cheuvreux de Virieu turns to sell on M6.</title>
<headline>Cheuvreux de Virieu turns to sell on M6.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broker Chevreux de Virieu has changed its recommendation for television group M6 to &quot;sell&quot; (3) from &quot;buy&quot; (2), according to fund managers.</p>
<p>The broker is of the opinion that due to the share's current value, a decline in advertisment spending in October and the uncertainties about the outlook for digital television group TPS, the M6 share will not outperform the market.</p>
<p>At 1128 GMT, M6 was 2.80 percent lower at 444.20 francs.</p>
</text>
